1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,395
Attention, all passengers.

2
00:00:02,095 --> 00:00:05,615
The City Hall Subway Station is now closed due to flooding.

3
00:00:05,875 --> 00:00:09,995
All subway trains on north- and south-bound routes have been halted.

4
00:00:11,215 --> 00:00:17,755
Passengers who are in City Hall Station are at present being assisted in leaving the building by emergency teams.

5
00:00:18,175 --> 00:00:24,695
We advise all commuters to take buses that will be running along both routes at approximately ten-minute intervals.

6
00:00:25,155 --> 00:00:29,955
We estimate that normal operations at City Hall Station will resume in two hours.

7
00:00:30,735 --> 00:00:32,775
We apologize for any inconvenience.
